    },
    {
      "id": "1572163185237037100",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-17T08:15:12.74+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "`PAD.19a_M2` is also basically just about CUP.\nDummy metal should be harmless from how I understand the risks of CUP-despite-wedge-bonding, and foundry cells are essentially immune _anyways._",
      "author": {
